    {
        "text": "11:37 P.M. \\ Cloudy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen, Sunset Boulevard, a certain bar, the last unwiped table near the back"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#3",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Jack of Spades. Straight flush. I win again, Gambino.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You win again. But you deal slower than I do with my toes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$bar_intro",
        "key": "$bar_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You backin' out again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up? Wish you knew how to shut up last night. Coulda saved us a lotta trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You been in Lungmen a long time, Capone. Maybe you need a reminder in how you talk to me, the boss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sit down, you moron. It's thanks to that temper of yours that business in Siracusa's so lousy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You been here seven or eight years, and what've you done besides learn some Lungmen swearings? You stood here and watched our channels dry up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm the one who got us a supporter last night. Try as you did to cock it up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "And besides, here in Lungmen, you and me are equals, 'boss.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The way this Rat King runs the show here, ain't it just the old worn out Siracusan tricks?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If only you could play a good Siracusan hand worth a damn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Too bad you're the worst card in it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We got a role to play in Lungmen. Think about it: we got a tired, broken down city with a rich underworld. It could be a new home for the Family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Only Siracusa can truly respect us, Capone. Don't forget the shame of being driven out of our home with our tails between our legs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't eat honor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wei Yenwu set some rules for this city. As long as we don't break 'em, we can run our rackets here just like before. Lungmen needs a little 'legitimate business.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I ain't seen you in years and I'm already gettin' sick of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Same same, boss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you not have your noisy lovers' quarrel in here? This lousy champagne's doin' enough to piss me off. Grab a bottle and take it outside, aight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get outta here. This don't concern you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch your tone. I'm the boss in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "We got a one-stop funeral service, if you're interested. 20% off if you both die together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey... ain't this guy...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...This is what we get since we left Siracusa. Nobody knows you're Sicilian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who gives a shit who you are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yo, Capone, do me a favor and torch this tacky joint. Call it 'urban beautification.' Wei Yenwu'll thank us for tearin' down a tastelessly decorated rathole.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Quiet! Don't provoke him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
